  m_text: '                 Advanced Tips\n\nIn fights use the environment to your <color=#64E632>advantage</color>. Getting knocked into a wall or into a unit will cause collision damage based on the force of the knockback.\n\nThe Emperor overseeing the tournament doesn''t want drawn out fights and will occasionally have special demands. It is best to keep him happy unless you are willing to face the <color=#FF4040>consequences</color>.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
